"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
1527,"Bundar told us, Muhammad bin Jaafar told us, Shu’bah told us, on the authority of Abdul Aziz bin Suhayb, on the authority of Anas. H, Yaqoub bin Ibrahim Al-Dawraqi, Ibn Ulayya, told us, Abdul Aziz told us, on the authority of Anas, he said: “The prayer was established and a man was speaking to us.” The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, until his companions fell asleep, then he got up and prayed.” Al-Dawrqi said: “Prayer was performed and the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, was met by a man at the side of the mosque. He did not get up to pray until some of them fell asleep.” ""the people"""
